  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.18 Fees for Inspections Related to Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.18 Fees for Inspections Related to Licensure.\n\n(a) Subject to (g) - (j), below, the fee for any inspection related to initial licensure shall be $150.\n\n(b) Subject to (g) - (j), below, the fee for any reinspection related to initial licensure shall be $100.\n\n(c) Subject to (g) - (j), below, the fee for any inspection related to renewal licensure shall be $150.\n\n(d) Subject to (g) - (j), below, the fee for any reinspection related to renewal licensure shall be $100.\n\n(e) Subject to (g) - (j), below, the fee for any inspection related to reinstatement of licensure shall be $150.\n\n(f) Subject to (g) - (j), below, the fee for any reinspection related to reinstatement of licensure shall be $100.\n\n(g) For general anesthesia, deep sedation, and moderate sedation permits for dentistry:\n\n(1) The fee for an initial facility inspection under Den 304.05 shall be $300; and\n\n(2) The fee for a comprehensive evaluation under Den 304.05 associated with initial licensing shall be $750.\n\n(h) The fee for inspection of an electrology school for initial licensure shall be $150.\n\n(i) The fee for an initial inspection of a funeral home, funeral chapel, or crematory for initial licensure shall be $250.\n\n(j) The fee for an initial site visit to a nursing program for initial licensure shall be $100.\n\nSource. #14289, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
